*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0020
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-02-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 515
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0020.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FEE0020C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    05 X-FE               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHARGE-EXCESS
    PERFORM HIGH-VOLUME-FEE
    DISPLAY "X-FE=" X-FE
    STOP RUN.
CHARGE-EXCESS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF WS-MTC GREATER THAN 15
        COMPUTE X-FE ROUNDED = (WS-MTC - 15) * 0.25
    END-IF.
HIGH-VOLUME-FEE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF AT-BUSINESS AND WS-MTC > 45
        ADD 10 TO X-FE
    END-IF.
